  "description": "TEZZAD crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 42/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C180 H196 N52 O40 S8 Yb8,4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb3 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb4 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb5 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb6 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors; Yb7 (Yb) has 3 O neighbors; Yb8 (Yb) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 4 components; largest component is a chain with insufficient metal sites for a 3D shape classification. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.689-3.689 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.56-105.27°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C180H192N52O44S8Yb8.",
